  "description": "• Multi-Character Team Battles\n Each character has unique skills and attributes, allowing flexible combinations based on combat needs. Whether you prefer powerful melee warriors or spell-casting mages, you’ll always find a role that suits your playstyle.\n\n• Flexible Formation Switching\n Choose to gather your team into a circular formation to boost attack power, or spread them out in a line to increase speed. With simple switching controls, you can react quickly to the ever-changing battlefield and unleash your team’s full potential.\n\n• Diverse Build Paths\n Different playstyles complement each other, enabling a wide variety of combat strategies. Explore countless possibilities, discover hidden combos and optimal builds, and let your heroes unleash their unique power and style in battle.\n\n• Fast-Paced Combat\n A quick and rhythmic combat system makes every strike feel impactful. Combined with smooth animations and dazzling skill effects, it delivers an addictive fast-paced fighting experience.",
